---
import AlexandrosZisimidis from "../../assets/testimonial/alexandros-zisimidis.jpg";
import GuillaumeMarquis from "../../assets/testimonial/guillaume-marquis.png";
import MaximeMouchet from "../../assets/testimonial/maxime-mouchet.jpg";
import Scroll from "./TestimonialsScroll.svelte";
import Testimonial from "../ui/Testimonial.astro";
import ZebraByteTestimonial from "../ui/ZebraByteTestimonial.astro";
import LalitKundu from "../../assets/testimonial/lalit-kundu.jpg";
import DimitriKassubeck from "../../assets/testimonial/dimitri-kassubeck.jpg";
import SonyaRikhtverchik from "../../assets/testimonial/sonya-rikhtverchik.jpg";
import FabienDevos from "../../assets/testimonial/fabien-devos.jpg";
import EfimMirochnik from "../../assets/testimonial/efim-mirochnik.jpg";
import BaptisteArnaud from "../../assets/testimonial/baptiste-arnaud.jpg";
import GavinBains from "../../assets/testimonial/gavin-bains.jpg";
import ChristopherPrice from "../../assets/testimonial/christopher-price.jpg";
import JoshParolin from "../../assets/testimonial/josh-parolin.jpg";
import JeremieParker from "../../assets/testimonial/jeremie-parker.jpg";
import PierreDePoulpiquet from "../../assets/testimonial/pierre-de-poulpiquet.jpg";
import AdityavardhanAgrawal from "../../assets/testimonial/Adityavardhan-Agrawal.jpg";
import CamilleEpitalon from "../../assets/testimonial/Camille Epitalon.png";
---

<section
  class="bg-linear-to-b from-[#F8FAF4] from-[0%] to-white to-[100%] py-10 sm:py-20"
>
  <h2 class="text-h3 sm:text-h2 mb-3 text-center font-medium">
    Compliance in practice
  </h2>
  <p class="text-muted-foreground mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg">
    Reference perspectives from real compliance journeys. These examples are
    preserved to show the outcomes and operating patterns a platform-and-expert
    model can enable; they are not presented as ZebraByte customer endorsements.
  </p>
  <Scroll client:load>
    <Testimonial
      image={AdityavardhanAgrawal}
      author="Adityavardhan Agrawal"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder at Morphik"
    >
      This case highlights a fast, straightforward compliance process with most
      of the operational work handled for the team and only clear action items
      left internally.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={CamilleEpitalon}
      author="Camille Epitalon"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & CTO at Verso"
    >
      This experience illustrates how compliance can fit into an existing async
      workflow, with low-friction collaboration instead of creating a separate
      operating process.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={PierreDePoulpiquet}
      author="Pierre de Poulpiquet"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & CTO at Whaly"
    >
      The reference journey shows the value of proactive expert support and a
      tailored certification workflow compared with a more generic automation-only
      experience.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={JeremieParker}
      author="Jérémie Parker"
      role="Reference perspective · CTO at Trace For Good"
    >
      A hands-on compliance model can absorb much of the heavy lifting while the
      customer team remains focused on the security and product work that only it
      can perform.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={JoshParolin}
      author="Josh Parolin"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & CTO at Sessionboard"
    >
      This case shows how structured guidance can replace months of fragmented
      tools, uncertainty and duplicated work with a clearer path from readiness
      through audit.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={ChristopherPrice}
      author="Christopher Price"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & COO at Sixtyfour"
    >
      The experience emphasizes professional, responsive support and a faster
      route to compliance for a team comparing several established GRC platforms.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={GavinBains}
      author="Gavin Bains"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder at The LLM Data Company"
    >
      This journey demonstrates the value of step-by-step guidance, organized
      evidence and expert ownership when preparing a small technical team for an
      audit.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={BaptisteArnaud}
      author="Baptiste Arnaud"
      role="Reference perspective · Founder at Typebot"
    >
      The reference case highlights a fast and human ISO 27001 process that could
      adapt to the realities of a very small company instead of assuming a large
      internal compliance department.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={EfimMirochnik}
      author="Efim Mirochnik"
      role="Reference perspective · CISO at Ahrefs"
    >
      This example shows how compliance can be adapted to existing engineering
      work while specialists absorb much of the operational burden and keep the
      program moving.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={FabienDevos}
      author="Fabien Devos"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & CTO at Vybe"
    >
      The SOC 2 journey illustrates how strong support and a well-structured
      workflow can make compliance significantly less disruptive for a product
      team.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={SonyaRikhtverchik}
      author="Sonya Rikhtverchik"
      role="Reference perspective · COO at Vybe"
    >
      This case is a useful reminder that a compliance program can feel manageable
      when evidence, ownership and expert guidance are organized in one place.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={DimitriKassubeck}
      author="Dimitri Kassubeck"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & CEO at Moby Analytics"
    >
      The underlying principle is simple: focus expert time on the controls and
      security decisions that matter instead of maximizing compliance busywork.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={LalitKundu}
      author="Lalit Kundu"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & CEO at Delty"
    >
      This experience shows the benefit of combining control implementation,
      explanation and vendor-security support when enterprise requirements arrive
      at the same time as a formal assurance program.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={MaximeMouchet}
      author="Maxime Mouchet"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & CTO at Clarifeye"
    >
      For companies facing demanding customer-security reviews, a rigorous and
      responsive compliance operating model can turn assurance into part of the
      sales and trust process.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={GuillaumeMarquis}
      author="Guillaume Marquis"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & CEO at Basalt"
    >
      The case illustrates a model where security and compliance are built around
      the way the company already operates, while specialist support handles much
      of the heavy lifting.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={AlexandrosZisimidis}
      author="Alexandros Zisimidis"
      role="Reference perspective · Co-founder & COO at Cleon"
    >
      A mature compliance partner should help a company decide which standards
      actually fit its business rather than pushing every available certification
      or license.
    </Testimonial>
  </Scroll>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-10 sm:py-20">
  <div class="container mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center">
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-3 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">
      ZebraByte customers
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-h3 sm:text-h2 mb-3 font-medium">
      Ce spun clienții ZebraByte
    </h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg">
      Feedback real din proiecte și servicii ZebraByte. Pe măsură ce construim
      propriile studii de caz de compliance, acestea vor înlocui gradual exemplele
      de referință de mai sus.
    </p>
  </div>

  <Scroll client:load>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Cosmin Szavui" role="Google review">
      Am avut site-ul plin de viruși și tot timpul îmi dădea erori. Nu mai mergea cum trebuie și nimeni nu știa ce are. Cei de la ZebraByte m-au ajutat imediat au curățat tot, au securizat site-ul și l-au mutat pe serverele lor. De atunci merge perfect și nu am mai avut nicio problemă. Se vede că știu ce fac și chiar se implică. Recomand 100%!
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Alexandra Aless" role="Google review">
      Am început să colaborez cu Zebrabyte de câteva luni și au livrat mai mult decât m-am asteptat. Am decis să îmi mut site-ul la ei deoarece am avut probleme cu vechiul provider și era și virusat. Cei de la ZebraByte au standarde foarte ridicate in ceea ce priveste securitatea și hosting enterprise. Echipa lor este foarte profesionistă, răspunde rapid la orice întrebare, oferă soluții clare si explica pe înțelesul tuturor chiar daca nu ai cunostinte tehnice. Platformele de hosting sunt stabile, rapide și bine protejate. Recomand cu încredere oricărei companii care are nevoie de hosting enterprise sigur și de suport solid în zona de securitate IT.
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Stefania Iancu" role="Google review">
      Am avut o problemă urâtă cu site-ul, tot primeam alerte de securitate și linkuri ciudate apăreau peste tot. Cei de la ZebraByte au intrat imediat, au curățat tot și l-au mutat la ei. De atunci merge fără probleme, chiar și mai repede. Foarte serioși!
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Bănuță Cristina" role="Google review">
      Super profi! Am colaborat foarte bine cu aceasta echipa. Toate cerintele au fost rezolvate intr-un timp foarte scurt. Recomand!
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Jadu Ro" role="Google review">
      Am lucrat extraordinar cu aceasta echipa. Ii recomand!
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Morosanu Gabriel" role="Trustpilot review">
      Very good team! Best cooperation i have ever seen. 10 stars!!!
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Ijugin Gowtham" role="Trustpilot review">
      I couldn’t be happier with the web hosting services from ZebraByte UK! Not only is my website running smoothly and reliably, but they also gave me a fantastic bonus—free business listing services. Their support team is just as amazing—always quick to assist and genuinely helpful.
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Laviclinic Jacob" role="Trustpilot review">
      It was really nice to design my website by Zebrabyte! The team was helpful and they established everything from A to Z, I liked the suggestions they gave. I’d like to thank Mr. Liviu especially for his assist.
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Florin novac" role="Trustpilot review">
      A expert team and very friendly. I recommend 100% and thank you for your hard work.
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Gabriela Ferguson" role="Trustpilot review">
      Excellent service, very understanding and patient with all our requests. I fully recommend ZebraByte for website designs to suit your needs!
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
    <ZebraByteTestimonial author="Callum Jones" role="Trustpilot review">
      The website was easy to understand and use. The support given helped me out to figure some of the website, the support was amazing and fast. I would recommend this app to anyone trying to host their own website.
    </ZebraByteTestimonial>
  </Scroll>
</section>
